If you're seeing this orchestrator for the first time, here's the 60-second mental model:

- **What it is**: an infrastructure layer for Claude Code that adds persistent memory (KG), semantic code search (code graph), and ~36 hooks that run automatically. You keep using Claude Code the way you already do; the orchestrator works in the background via hooks and MCP servers.
